      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然爸爸傍晚就要去飞下一班班机了，\n只有一点点时间能聊天──",
      "source_fingerprint": "12077113c295567b7173fbfc73ac67738307fdf82553e76d4d8bc2dafa031dc3",
