      "uid": "zhcn:3e9a37717af4cf694b3addda",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "既然这样，我这个外人还是别打扰……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ca090b5ac80857b750fd1dae9c1b9449e7485909551f60f361c5d17efb42308",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
