      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但毕竟一年内能见到爸爸的机会\n只有少少几次，要趁机多聊聊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "240b09a657046732b586fc75738f3a4c3632a938264a3cc97af606459af0a994",
