      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不行！我也想介绍训练员给爸爸啊！\n爸爸也说我一个人过去太危险了──",
      "source_fingerprint": "3776fdd0b1e9b7a4289914b0b4414d846d4466caa5d3d5fbd190ae1c2c269776",
